CERT Polska's disclosure covers the DHTMLX PDF Export Module used by Gantt and Scheduler and Diagram's export module, and states nothing about deployments in EU e-government, healthcare or municipal tools. CVE-2026-41552 and CVE-2026-7182 are file-read flaws that pull local server files into the generated PDF, not code execution. The PDF Export Module from 0.3.3 is fixed in 0.7.6 and Diagram from 1.0.0 in 1.1.1.
